WEBVTT

01:35.690 --> 01:40.759
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.450 --> 01:43.910
[Episode 1]

01:46.509 --> 01:48.950
-Your Highness!
-Your Highness!

01:50.870 --> 01:51.789
Your Highness!

01:51.789 --> 01:53.050
Protect His Highness!

01:53.789 --> 01:54.840
Your Highness!

01:55.000 --> 01:56.759
Your Highness!

01:57.070 --> 01:59.000
Do something!

01:59.000 --> 02:00.430
Protect His Highness!

02:00.480 --> 02:01.760
Your Highness!

02:02.200 --> 02:04.430
Protect His Highness!

02:04.870 --> 02:05.640
Hurry!

02:06.000 --> 02:07.870
Protect His Highness!

02:09.800 --> 02:11.460
Your Highness, hang in there!

02:11.680 --> 02:12.750
Help!

02:13.000 --> 02:14.080
Your Highness!

02:16.750 --> 02:17.910
Kill!

02:17.910 --> 02:19.170
Protect His Highness!

02:19.710 --> 02:21.240
Protect His Highness!

02:21.280 --> 02:22.140
Your Highness!

02:35.079 --> 02:35.800
Kill!

02:40.750 --> 02:41.520
Kill!

02:43.690 --> 02:46.710
[Susha Kingdom's First Prince, Feng Suige]

02:50.560 --> 02:53.870
Kill!

03:51.150 --> 03:52.030
Kill!

04:36.920 --> 04:38.870
Your Highness!

04:38.950 --> 04:39.830
Your Highness!

04:40.390 --> 04:41.270
Your Highness!

04:41.750 --> 04:44.000
Protect His Highness!

04:45.310 --> 04:46.280
[Pingling City]

04:49.120 --> 04:53.740
[Military Commander of Jinxiu Kingdom,
Fu Yixiao]

04:57.950 --> 04:59.360
[Jinxiu Kingdom and Susha Kingdom]

04:59.360 --> 05:00.510
[are neighboring enemies.]

05:00.510 --> 05:02.310
[Their enmity runs deep as the sea.]

05:02.310 --> 05:04.160
[The First Prince of Susha Kingdom, Feng Suige,]

05:04.160 --> 05:06.070
[led the army to attack Jinxiu's border.]

05:06.070 --> 05:07.070
[Zhennan Pass]

05:07.310 --> 05:09.190
[When Jinxiu Kingdom was on
the cusp of being defeated,]

05:09.190 --> 05:11.000
[the woman in red, Fu Yixiao,]

05:11.240 --> 05:12.680
[shot and injured Feng Suige,]

05:12.680 --> 05:14.540
[turning the situation around.]

05:15.390 --> 05:17.360
[Feng Suige failed at the last minute,]

05:17.360 --> 05:20.290
[and the army of Susha
had to withdraw immediately.]

05:28.120 --> 05:28.980
Your Highness.

05:29.190 --> 05:30.120
Yun Fang and his men

05:30.120 --> 05:31.270
are stopping Jinxiu's pursuing forces.

05:31.270 --> 05:32.110
These assassins in black

05:32.110 --> 05:33.000
are not sent by Jinxiu.

05:33.000 --> 05:34.120
Then who are they?

05:43.830 --> 05:44.390
Gu Yu.

05:44.680 --> 05:45.830
Take His Highness away.

05:45.830 --> 05:46.490
I'll cover.

05:47.130 --> 05:48.340
[Susha Kingdom's Feng Battalion,
Lieutenant Lu Ke]

05:59.000 --> 06:01.000
We've barely dealt with the last group,
yet here comes the next.

06:00.040 --> 06:00.550
[Susha Kingdom's Feng Battalion, Gu Yu]

06:01.160 --> 06:02.760
It looks like there are traps

06:02.870 --> 06:03.870
all along the way.

06:46.630 --> 06:47.190
Retreat!

06:56.000 --> 06:57.560
[At the Battle of Ping Ling,]

06:57.560 --> 06:59.000
[Jinxiu Kingdom's Zhennan Army]

06:59.000 --> 06:59.360
[fended off]

06:59.360 --> 07:00.960
[Feng Suige's army of Susha]

07:01.160 --> 07:02.620
[and won a great victory.]

07:03.070 --> 07:04.730
[But on the night of victory,]

07:04.830 --> 07:06.160
[Zhennan Army's foremost commander,]

07:06.160 --> 07:07.950
[the Red-Clad General Fu Yixiao,]

07:07.950 --> 07:09.120
[went missing.]

07:36.870 --> 07:37.670
Surround him!

08:18.310 --> 08:22.150
[Zhengnian Villa's Young Master,
Ling Xueying]

08:23.040 --> 08:23.750
My Lady,

08:24.270 --> 08:25.560
can we go back now?

08:26.040 --> 08:27.190
I'm so hungry.

08:28.510 --> 08:29.270
Eleven.

08:29.630 --> 08:31.120
It will take us some time to go back.

08:31.120 --> 08:32.000
The new prescription given the other day

08:32.000 --> 08:33.600
was overly potent for the patient.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.000
Although he was cured of
the stubborn disease,

08:35.000 --> 08:36.799
he had diarrhoea for three days.

08:37.240 --> 08:39.030
I'm afraid they'll talk about me.

08:39.030 --> 08:39.960
I'd better hide.

08:40.390 --> 08:42.360
Others offer a one-for-one deal
for produce,

08:42.360 --> 08:43.320
but you do so

08:43.549 --> 08:44.950
when treating patients.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.240
All right. Let's go.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.080
Eleven!

08:57.360 --> 08:57.960
Eleven!

09:26.390 --> 09:27.080
Have you seen

09:27.080 --> 09:28.000
a woman in red?

09:28.600 --> 09:29.670
I... I haven't.

09:29.670 --> 09:30.480
I saw nothing.

09:30.510 --> 09:32.150
I'm just here to gather herbs.

09:32.150 --> 09:33.010
I know nothing.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.360
Then you're useless.

09:35.670 --> 09:36.360
Give chase!

10:13.720 --> 10:16.470
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

10:17.240 --> 10:19.440
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

10:19.990 --> 10:22.770
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

10:23.450 --> 10:25.860
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

10:26.620 --> 10:29.580
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

10:30.160 --> 10:32.740
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

10:33.170 --> 10:35.940
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

10:36.660 --> 10:40.020
♪ All I ask is to be together
forever ♪

10:40.390 --> 10:40.910
Miss!

10:41.720 --> 10:42.650
Don't come over!

10:43.480 --> 10:44.120
You're injured.

10:44.120 --> 10:44.840
I'm a physician.

10:44.840 --> 10:45.840
Let me take a look.

10:47.320 --> 10:49.670
Leave if you don't want to die.

10:51.750 --> 10:52.600
Go!

11:02.870 --> 11:03.510
Miss!

11:05.870 --> 11:06.390
Miss!

11:08.080 --> 11:08.670
This...

11:09.360 --> 11:10.270
Miss, wake up!

11:11.900 --> 11:17.130
[Zhengnian Villa]

11:16.720 --> 11:17.630
If Fu Yixiao

11:17.630 --> 11:19.080
attacked our First Prince...

11:19.080 --> 11:21.000
The army of Susha had already
broke through Zhennan Pass!

11:21.000 --> 11:22.080
All of you from Jinxiu are cowards!

11:22.080 --> 11:24.280
[Zhengnian Villa]

11:23.240 --> 11:24.630
Stop arguing!

11:25.670 --> 11:27.200
Stop arguing!

11:27.870 --> 11:30.470
You won't get treated
if you continue arguing!

11:31.080 --> 11:32.080
All right.

11:31.840 --> 11:35.210
[Zhengnian Villa]

11:32.080 --> 11:33.390
Stop arguing!

11:33.750 --> 11:34.960
Stop arguing!

11:35.550 --> 11:37.320
Stop arguing!

11:39.590 --> 11:47.010
[Zhengnian Villa]

11:43.390 --> 11:45.050
The rules of Zhengnian Villa.

11:45.480 --> 11:47.280
Do you all need me to say it again?

11:47.340 --> 11:51.940
[Disarm oneself]

11:48.320 --> 11:49.120
This stone...

11:49.510 --> 11:51.910
bears the writing of
Susha's Emperor.

11:52.020 --> 11:56.770
[Cease hostilities]

11:53.270 --> 11:54.070
That stone...

11:54.270 --> 11:56.730
is the edict issued by
Jinxiu's Her Majesty.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.270
To clash and fight here

11:59.360 --> 12:00.550
shows utter disregard for law

11:59.450 --> 12:02.270
[Zhengnian Villa]

12:00.960 --> 12:03.020
and defiance of the imperial decree!

12:04.440 --> 12:05.240
Go ahead!

12:07.030 --> 12:09.090
So all of you are going to stop, right?

12:09.200 --> 12:10.960
Hurry inside and get treated.

12:11.150 --> 12:12.010
If you are late,

12:12.550 --> 12:14.480
even the herbal dregs will be gone.

12:26.030 --> 12:26.750
My Lady!

12:27.720 --> 12:28.240
Mr. Qin!

12:28.510 --> 12:29.710
You're finally back.

12:30.390 --> 12:30.870
Mr. Qin.

12:30.870 --> 12:31.630
Slowly.

12:32.630 --> 12:33.150
My Lady.

12:33.440 --> 12:35.320
How did she became this badly injured?

12:35.320 --> 12:36.520
Mr. Qin, stop asking.

12:36.750 --> 12:37.630
Get someone to carry her in.

12:37.630 --> 12:39.080
Let's boil some hot water first.

12:39.080 --> 12:39.840
Okay.

12:39.840 --> 12:40.300
Eleven.

12:40.360 --> 12:41.630
Prepare medicine for external injuries.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.750
Prismatic needles, surgical blades,

12:42.750 --> 12:43.440
and morus string.

12:43.440 --> 12:44.120
I got it.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.080
It looks like there are traps

13:01.080 --> 13:02.080
all along the way.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.670
It seems that if I don't die,

13:04.670 --> 13:06.670
they are not going to give up easily.

13:07.120 --> 13:09.630
Then let's fulfil their wish.

14:12.150 --> 14:14.480
Although I extracted the arrow
from his body,

14:14.480 --> 14:15.600
the arrow wound is too deep.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.150
The wound can't heal.

14:17.390 --> 14:19.670
There's not much else I can do.

14:27.720 --> 14:28.270
You can go.

14:28.270 --> 14:29.130
Thank you, Sir.

14:29.240 --> 14:30.500
Thank you so much, Sir.

14:31.870 --> 14:32.510
Here.

14:34.270 --> 14:35.130
Your Highness.

14:36.150 --> 14:37.960
What's the death and injury count

14:37.960 --> 14:39.550
for the Feng Battalion?

14:43.000 --> 14:43.510
To cover

14:43.510 --> 14:45.970
the main army's retreat,
more than half from

14:46.000 --> 14:48.200
Feng Battalion were killed or wounded.

14:53.000 --> 14:54.600
Don't worry, Your Highness.

14:54.630 --> 14:56.830
I've done everything you've asked for.

14:59.390 --> 15:00.750
After the war,

15:01.000 --> 15:02.320
our spies within Jinxiu

15:02.320 --> 15:04.580
will track this person down at all costs.

15:06.630 --> 15:08.290
Your Highness, hang in there.

15:09.750 --> 15:11.280
I'll take you back to Susha.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.600
I won't make it to Susha.

15:16.720 --> 15:17.910
There is a place...

15:18.480 --> 15:20.480
that might be able to save my life.

15:27.550 --> 15:28.200
My Lady.

15:28.790 --> 15:30.480
Will... she be alright?

15:31.120 --> 15:32.150
What are you saying?

15:32.150 --> 15:33.360
I personally handled it myself.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.490
How can I let her die?

15:34.960 --> 15:36.000
Go find some clean gauze

15:36.000 --> 15:36.790
and wrap her up.

15:36.790 --> 15:38.050
Remember to be gentle.

15:38.720 --> 15:39.270
Okay.

15:59.600 --> 16:01.440
Two of you shall stay
to clean this place up.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.720
Let's take our dead brothers back

16:02.720 --> 16:03.720
for their burial.

16:04.550 --> 16:05.750
What about Fu Yixiao?

16:06.240 --> 16:07.000
Our Lord said

16:07.630 --> 16:09.230
we must see her alive or dead.

16:09.750 --> 16:10.480
Keep searching!

16:10.480 --> 16:11.480
Yes!

16:14.790 --> 16:16.810
[Zhengnian Villa]

16:46.660 --> 16:48.950
[Susha Kingdom's imperial palace]

17:06.500 --> 17:10.660
[Emperor of Susha Kingdom, Feng Pingcheng]

17:14.440 --> 17:15.880
Arrange the imperial physician

17:15.880 --> 17:17.160
to treat him.

17:17.640 --> 17:18.240
Yes.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.560
Take him away for treatment.

17:24.950 --> 17:26.150
[Imperial Censor of Susha Kingdom,
Wang Lang]

17:27.000 --> 17:27.920
Your Majesty,

17:28.590 --> 17:29.750
we have been preparing

17:29.750 --> 17:30.750
for the Battle of Ping Ling

17:30.750 --> 17:31.920
for two years.

17:32.510 --> 17:34.110
We have rich provisions

17:34.510 --> 17:35.840
and countless weapons.

17:35.880 --> 17:38.010
The soldiers are also high-spirited.

17:38.640 --> 17:39.310
This battle

17:39.590 --> 17:41.750
should have been sure-win.

17:39.660 --> 17:42.100
[Prime Minister of Susha Kingdom,
Zhuang Shen]

17:41.790 --> 17:43.270
If it's a sure-win,

17:43.590 --> 17:44.960
then why did we lose?

17:46.930 --> 17:48.540
[Vice Minister of Justice of Susha Kingdom,
Zhuang Ming]

17:47.070 --> 17:47.920
I heard that

17:48.200 --> 17:49.270
at the Battle of Ping Ling,

17:49.270 --> 17:50.400
our army has already broke through

17:50.400 --> 17:51.790
the doors of Zhennan Pass.

17:51.790 --> 17:53.050
But at the last moment,

17:53.350 --> 17:55.440
the First Prince was shot off his horse

17:54.580 --> 17:56.260
[Minister of War of Susha Kingdom,
Hou Jing]

17:55.790 --> 17:57.390
by an enemy general’s arrow.

17:57.750 --> 18:00.350
With our commander-in-chief shot,
the army fell into disarray.

18:00.350 --> 18:02.550
That's why we failed.

18:04.960 --> 18:05.920
I disagree.

18:06.440 --> 18:08.550
There are no eyes on the battlefield.

18:08.920 --> 18:09.550
Moreover,

18:09.720 --> 18:11.350
Zhennan Pass stands within
treacherous mountains

18:11.350 --> 18:12.750
It's easy to defend but hard to attack.

18:12.750 --> 18:13.960
The First Prince used only

18:13.960 --> 18:15.310
8,000 soldiers and horses

18:15.310 --> 18:17.510
to break through the gate of Zhennan Pass.

18:17.510 --> 18:18.200
This is already

18:18.200 --> 18:19.640
an unprecedented feat.

18:19.830 --> 18:21.400
But didn't we lose?

18:22.270 --> 18:23.070
Your Majesty.

18:23.110 --> 18:23.910
I believe that

18:24.270 --> 18:25.670
in the defeat at Ping Ling

18:25.790 --> 18:26.720
the First Prince

18:27.400 --> 18:28.680
cannot escape blame.

18:34.350 --> 18:35.150
Your Majesty.

18:35.590 --> 18:37.440
The First Prince has been
seriously injured.

18:37.440 --> 18:39.480
His safety concerns the fate of the state.

18:39.480 --> 18:40.310
The most pressing thing now

18:40.310 --> 18:41.680
is to send someone

18:41.680 --> 18:43.640
to bring him back safely to Susha.

18:44.350 --> 18:45.480
The First Prince can

18:45.640 --> 18:47.160
personally explain the reasons for

18:47.160 --> 18:49.490
the defeat upon his return to the capital.

18:56.750 --> 18:57.270
Uncle.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.070
Within our court of Susha,

18:59.070 --> 19:01.270
half has always favored peace,
while the other half favored war.

19:01.270 --> 19:02.680
With the defeat of Ping Ling,

19:02.680 --> 19:04.000
those peace-favoring officials

19:04.000 --> 19:05.510
will definitely harp on this.

19:05.330 --> 19:08.190
[Taiji Hall]

19:06.480 --> 19:08.400
Why didn't you take the opportunity

19:08.400 --> 19:09.800
to challenge Feng Suige?

19:10.350 --> 19:11.610
No father in this world

19:11.680 --> 19:13.270
will be willing to hear others

19:13.270 --> 19:14.550
blame their own son.

19:14.790 --> 19:16.320
Feng Suige might have lost.

19:16.590 --> 19:17.270
But...

19:18.030 --> 19:19.790
he broke through
the doors of Zhennan Pass.

19:19.790 --> 19:21.190
It was a glorious defeat.

19:22.000 --> 19:23.860
Uncle, why are you defending him?

19:24.480 --> 19:25.240
The news of his defeat

19:25.240 --> 19:27.030
has spread throughout Yujing City.

19:27.030 --> 19:27.880
Soon,

19:27.920 --> 19:29.030
he will become the target

19:29.030 --> 19:30.440
of public condemnation.

19:29.260 --> 19:33.260
[Taiji Hall]

19:30.960 --> 19:32.200
His Majesty must also be

19:32.200 --> 19:33.480
very disappointed in him.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.070
Besides,

19:34.830 --> 19:36.230
he's seriously injured.

19:36.440 --> 19:38.440
If he can come back safely,

19:38.590 --> 19:40.250
it's only because he's lucky.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.590
But if something bad

19:41.590 --> 19:43.120
happens to him on the way...

19:45.640 --> 19:46.790
What did you do?

19:49.200 --> 19:50.000
Uncle.

19:51.070 --> 19:51.680
This is

19:51.680 --> 19:53.680
an extremely rare opportunity.

19:54.440 --> 19:55.970
If you want to die, go ahead.

19:56.350 --> 19:57.610
Don't get me involved.

20:06.790 --> 20:07.680
Commander Fu!

20:08.790 --> 20:09.920
Commander Fu!

20:10.160 --> 20:11.160
Where are you?

20:11.680 --> 20:12.680
Commander Fu!

20:13.110 --> 20:14.000
Commander Fu!

20:14.720 --> 20:15.510
Commander Fu!

20:15.510 --> 20:16.400
Commander Fu!

20:18.510 --> 20:19.480
Commander Fu!

20:20.200 --> 20:21.110
Commander Fu!

20:21.980 --> 20:24.180
[Jinxiu Kingdom's Prince of Zhennan,
Xia Jingshi]

20:24.960 --> 20:28.880
[Military Advisor of Zhennan Army,
Xiao Weiran]

20:25.750 --> 20:26.510
Yixiao!

20:28.030 --> 20:28.750
Yixiao!

20:30.240 --> 20:30.960
Yixiao!

20:31.880 --> 20:32.720
Your Highness.

20:32.720 --> 20:33.580
Your Highness.

20:33.960 --> 20:34.880
We've been searching tirelessly

20:34.880 --> 20:36.070
for several days now.

20:36.070 --> 20:37.550
You should go back and rest.

20:37.550 --> 20:38.610
What about Yixiao?

20:39.310 --> 20:40.960
There's a river under the cliff.

20:40.960 --> 20:42.830
She must have fallen into the river

20:42.830 --> 20:43.960
and got washed away.

20:44.070 --> 20:45.720
We've searched both riverbanks and

20:45.720 --> 20:47.000
all the surrounding woods.

20:47.000 --> 20:48.200
If she is still alive,

20:48.350 --> 20:49.880
she would have left a trace.

20:50.160 --> 20:50.830
But now...

20:51.830 --> 20:52.960
We've found nothing.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.240
Shut up!

21:00.680 --> 21:02.010
She must still be alive.

21:02.350 --> 21:03.680
She must still be alive.

21:04.720 --> 21:06.510
Expand the search area and keep looking.

21:06.510 --> 21:08.200
Even if it means going to
the corners of the world,

21:08.200 --> 21:09.110
I must find her!

21:09.510 --> 21:10.200
Yes!

21:11.920 --> 21:12.640
Yixiao!

21:14.830 --> 21:16.230
-Commander Fu!
-Yixiao!

21:23.830 --> 21:26.000
It's been a long time.
Why hasn't she woken up?

21:26.000 --> 21:27.260
She's not dead, right?

21:28.030 --> 21:29.240
How dare you question me?

21:29.240 --> 21:31.240
Do you not want to stay here anymore?

21:32.550 --> 21:34.030
Maybe it's because she's badly injured.

21:34.030 --> 21:34.750
I used a strong dosage of

21:34.750 --> 21:36.160
the Fivefold Anaesthetic Powder.

21:36.160 --> 21:38.270
It's okay. She just needs
a few more days of sleep.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.920
At least the wound is recovering well.

21:39.920 --> 21:41.850
We can remove the splint and gauze.

22:02.880 --> 22:03.440
My Lady!

22:05.640 --> 22:06.310
Don't move.

22:07.160 --> 22:08.200
What are you doing?

22:08.200 --> 22:08.830
My Lady just

22:08.830 --> 22:09.760
saved your life!

22:10.030 --> 22:11.160
How ungrateful!

22:12.240 --> 22:13.550
Are you extorting money?

22:13.550 --> 22:14.210
1,000 guan?

22:14.400 --> 22:15.070
Okay?

22:16.510 --> 22:17.070
2,000?

22:17.270 --> 22:18.000
2,000 guan?

22:20.270 --> 22:21.480
T-T-Three...

22:27.070 --> 22:28.470
My Lady, are you alright?

22:29.310 --> 22:30.960
The anaesthetic effect
hasn't worn off yet.

22:30.960 --> 22:33.200
Push too hard, and one will
collapse from exhaustion.

22:33.200 --> 22:34.240
Within 3 counts,

22:34.680 --> 22:35.540
she would fall.

22:36.310 --> 22:37.170
I was so scared.

22:40.640 --> 22:41.570
Don't come over.

22:42.070 --> 22:42.930
Don't touch me.

22:52.640 --> 22:53.480
Who are you?

22:53.960 --> 22:54.920
Have you forgotten?

22:54.920 --> 22:56.680
You saved me in the forest that day.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.830
You were badly injured,

22:57.830 --> 22:59.030
so I brought you back.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.060
What is this place?

23:02.550 --> 23:03.950
This is Zhengnian Villa.

23:04.070 --> 23:05.270
We treat people here.

23:05.750 --> 23:07.070
I'm the Young Mistress here.

23:07.070 --> 23:08.400
My name is Ling Xueying.

23:09.160 --> 23:10.490
We simply met by chance.

23:10.920 --> 23:11.980
Why did you save me?

23:13.160 --> 23:14.090
I'm a physician.

23:14.270 --> 23:15.920
It's my duty to save and cure people.

23:15.920 --> 23:17.480
No, let me tell you.

23:17.830 --> 23:19.480
You were hunted down
in the forest that day.

23:19.480 --> 23:20.210
Before that,

23:20.350 --> 23:22.160
you should have fallen
from a high place, I suppose.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.480
After we got you back,

23:23.830 --> 23:25.030
we found that your head was injured.

23:25.030 --> 23:26.070
Your internal organs were displaced,

23:26.070 --> 23:27.640
and the bones and tendons
in your left hand were shattered.

23:27.640 --> 23:29.350
Luckily, you met Her Ladyship.

23:29.350 --> 23:30.880
She set your bones
and stitched your wounds,

23:30.880 --> 23:32.470
and it took her
3 whole days and nights.

23:32.470 --> 23:33.310
It

23:33.440 --> 23:34.480
took everything out of her

23:34.480 --> 23:35.440
to save your life.

23:35.440 --> 23:36.110
Besides,

23:36.270 --> 23:37.310
if I want to hurt you,

23:37.310 --> 23:38.970
why would I bother to save you?

23:39.000 --> 23:39.640
Exactly.

23:41.200 --> 23:41.750
Miss,

23:42.200 --> 23:43.350
what's your name?

23:46.310 --> 23:47.720
My name?

23:52.790 --> 23:53.480
My Lady.

23:54.400 --> 23:55.730
Has she lost her memory?

23:57.110 --> 23:58.000
Besides not remembering

23:58.000 --> 23:58.830
your name,

23:59.070 --> 24:00.800
do you remember anything else?

24:03.270 --> 24:03.920
Oh no.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.720
She must have amnesia.

24:06.310 --> 24:08.510
Amnesia is the most difficult to treat.

24:15.000 --> 24:16.400
Your left shoulder was shot by an arrow.

24:16.400 --> 24:17.930
You can't move your arm now.

24:18.030 --> 24:19.070
Looks like your wound

24:19.070 --> 24:19.680
was from an arrow that pierced you

24:19.680 --> 24:21.270
in 5 steps face-to-face.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.400
In 5 steps?

24:26.030 --> 24:26.830
That's right.

24:27.480 --> 24:29.080
I've seen many arrow wounds.

24:29.160 --> 24:29.960
But I've never seen such a wound

24:29.960 --> 24:31.070
like yours.

24:31.720 --> 24:32.680
Logically, given the close distance

24:32.680 --> 24:34.270
and your defenseless state,

24:34.270 --> 24:35.200
it seems that you were

24:35.200 --> 24:37.600
shot by an arrow
from someone you know well.

24:44.880 --> 24:46.200
Forget it. Get recovered first.

24:46.200 --> 24:47.640
We'll talk about it later.

24:47.640 --> 24:48.640
You've moved too vigorously,

24:48.640 --> 24:49.960
and you must have strained your tendons
again.

24:49.960 --> 24:50.880
Let me get her some medicine.

24:50.880 --> 24:51.480
No need.

24:52.960 --> 24:54.680
It's too late to apply the medicine now.

24:54.680 --> 24:55.110
We can only send her

24:55.110 --> 24:58.310
to the medical pool at the back mountain
and take a chance.

25:09.830 --> 25:10.790
The pool

25:10.790 --> 25:12.960
contains various rare herbs
from around the world,

25:12.960 --> 25:14.270
from Saffron beyond the pass

25:14.270 --> 25:16.400
to the Tianshan Snow Lotus
in the frozen lands.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.790
Anyway, it works wonders

25:17.790 --> 25:19.790
for all kinds of external injuries.

25:23.790 --> 25:25.270
This is called
the Primordial Qi Consolidating Powder.

25:25.270 --> 25:26.960
For ordinary wounds,

25:27.030 --> 25:27.960
whether they're festering
or bleeding nonstop,

25:27.960 --> 25:29.550
taking it will work wonders.

25:29.550 --> 25:31.610
After you soak in the pool and take it,

25:32.000 --> 25:34.030
even if your tendons can't be reconnected,

25:34.030 --> 25:36.560
it will at least
ease the pain significantly.

25:38.960 --> 25:40.550
Don't underestimate it.

25:40.590 --> 25:41.750
In order to make it,

25:41.880 --> 25:42.920
Her Ladyship
went all over Susha and Jinxiu

25:42.920 --> 25:44.160
to look for herbs

25:44.440 --> 25:45.960
for the entire 4 years.

25:48.200 --> 25:49.660
If you had meant to harm me,

25:49.880 --> 25:51.410
you wouldn't have saved me.

25:51.510 --> 25:52.310
In that case,

25:53.440 --> 25:54.640
it can't be poison.

25:55.270 --> 25:55.790
Here.

25:55.830 --> 25:57.270
How could it be poison?

25:57.790 --> 25:59.320
You are being too cautious.

25:59.400 --> 26:00.110
Who do you take

26:00.110 --> 26:00.790
Her Ladyship for?

26:00.790 --> 26:01.350
Eleven.

26:01.790 --> 26:03.400
She just
went through a life-or-death situation.

26:03.400 --> 26:05.130
It's only right to be cautious.

26:06.880 --> 26:07.510
Thanks.

26:09.590 --> 26:11.510
This is the forbidden place
of Zhengnian Villa.

26:11.510 --> 26:13.030
Those who know about this place
in the world

26:13.030 --> 26:14.310
have a deep connection with the villa

26:14.310 --> 26:15.960
and with my father.

26:16.310 --> 26:17.830
They are our friends.

26:18.480 --> 26:19.030
Miss,

26:19.350 --> 26:20.240
don't worry.

26:39.510 --> 26:41.270
Soaking the wound in the medical pool

26:41.270 --> 26:42.640
will hurt at first.

26:43.030 --> 26:43.920
After a moment,

26:44.000 --> 26:45.460
you'll slowly become dull

26:45.480 --> 26:46.610
and fall into a coma.

26:46.750 --> 26:47.790
You'll feel dizzy

26:47.830 --> 26:49.000
in the process.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.400
All these mean the herbs are working.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.200
Don't worry.

26:59.270 --> 26:59.960
Be careful.

27:00.110 --> 27:01.640
Be careful, Your Highness.

27:02.510 --> 27:03.370
Your Highness.

27:03.550 --> 27:04.720
This is the back mountain
of Zhengnian Villa.

27:04.720 --> 27:05.850
What are we here for?

27:06.030 --> 27:07.480
I heard from Lord Ling

27:07.880 --> 27:09.110
that there is a forbidden place

27:09.110 --> 27:10.510
in the back mountain of Zhengnian Villa.

27:10.510 --> 27:12.110
There is a medical pool inside.

27:12.110 --> 27:14.840
It's a perfect place
to treat external injuries.

27:14.960 --> 27:15.550
Is there really such a mysterious place

27:15.550 --> 27:17.000
in this world?

27:17.720 --> 27:18.400
Gu Yu.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.070
Wait outside.

27:20.680 --> 27:21.880
I'll go in alone.

27:22.750 --> 27:23.880
I'll go with you, Your Highness.

27:23.880 --> 27:24.830
Go find Yun Fang

27:25.200 --> 27:28.000
and reorganize the old troops
as soon as possible.

27:28.200 --> 27:28.790
Yes.

27:29.350 --> 27:30.610
Protect His Highness.

29:02.650 --> 29:04.570
[Zhengnian Villa]

29:11.000 --> 29:12.880
Fu Yixiao has been seriously injured.

29:12.880 --> 29:14.510
It's very likely that she'll come here.

29:14.510 --> 29:15.570
Search carefully.

29:19.350 --> 29:20.640
My Lady! My Lady!

29:22.110 --> 29:22.830
What's wrong?

29:22.830 --> 29:23.360
Bad news!

29:23.590 --> 29:24.510
Slow down.

29:24.830 --> 29:26.270
A lot of soldiers are here!

29:26.040 --> 29:29.760
[Zhengnian Villa]

29:34.680 --> 29:35.510
What are you doing?

29:35.330 --> 29:37.920
[Ning Fei, Guard Officer
from Prince Zhennan's Mansion]

29:35.680 --> 29:37.030
I'm Ning Fei, Guard Officer
from Prince Zhennan's Mansion.

29:37.030 --> 29:38.110
Miss, may I ask if you...

29:38.110 --> 29:39.240
You came uninvited.

29:39.440 --> 29:41.400
How dare you call yourselves soldiers?

29:41.400 --> 29:43.260
I think you're more like bandits.

29:43.750 --> 29:44.440
Take it.

29:44.830 --> 29:46.360
I just want to find someone.

29:46.830 --> 29:48.030
A girl in her twenties

29:48.030 --> 29:48.790
in red

29:48.880 --> 29:50.340
who got severely injured.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.490
Have you actually seen her?

29:55.790 --> 29:56.310
Search!

29:56.480 --> 29:57.110
Yes!

29:58.830 --> 29:59.790
What are you doing?

29:59.790 --> 30:00.960
What are you doing?

30:01.070 --> 30:02.310
-Stop!
-Stop!

30:02.350 --> 30:03.000
What are you doing?

30:03.000 --> 30:04.480
We're Miss Yixiao's brothers.

30:04.480 --> 30:05.480
What Miss Yixiao?

30:05.880 --> 30:07.030
What are you talking about?

30:07.030 --> 30:07.750
Stop pretending.

30:07.750 --> 30:08.720
She must be here!

30:09.070 --> 30:09.920
Did she get hurt?

30:09.920 --> 30:11.180
Did she get hurt badly?

30:11.480 --> 30:11.880
Let go!

30:11.880 --> 30:12.270
Let go!

30:12.270 --> 30:12.960
Don't lay a hand on her!

30:12.960 --> 30:13.590
I'm her brother!

30:13.590 --> 30:14.830
I'm here to take her home!

30:14.830 --> 30:15.480
Brother?

30:15.480 --> 30:16.000
Yes!

30:17.070 --> 30:17.920
Most people in this world

30:17.920 --> 30:18.880
are betrayers.

30:19.270 --> 30:20.750
They call each other brothers
on the surface,

30:20.750 --> 30:22.110
but hurt each other behind their backs!

30:22.110 --> 30:23.640
What are you talking about?

30:23.830 --> 30:24.790
Whether I saw an injured girl

30:24.790 --> 30:25.720
doesn't matter.

30:26.110 --> 30:27.170
Even if she's here,

30:27.680 --> 30:28.590
I will never

30:29.030 --> 30:29.680
hand her over,

30:29.680 --> 30:31.010
given what you've done!

31:27.790 --> 31:28.510
Who is it?

31:34.790 --> 31:36.400
I'm sorry for offending you so much.

31:36.400 --> 31:37.460
Please forgive me.

31:37.750 --> 31:39.480
Lord Ling and I are old friends.

31:39.680 --> 31:41.340
I need to use this place today.

31:41.480 --> 31:43.480
I will explain it to him
face-to-face later.

31:43.480 --> 31:45.010
You still haven't answered

31:45.400 --> 31:46.270
who you are.

32:28.440 --> 32:29.750
-Officer Ning.
-Go ahead.

32:29.750 --> 32:30.400
Not found.

32:31.510 --> 32:32.790
We've searched the pharmacy,
but we couldn't find her.

32:32.790 --> 32:35.320
We've searched
but couldn't find her either.

32:35.680 --> 32:37.160
Have you searched thoroughly?

32:37.160 --> 32:40.560
We've searched everywhere,
but we really couldn't find her.

32:44.830 --> 32:46.270
Susha and Jinxiu have fought for years.

32:46.270 --> 32:47.110
They've set a rule

32:47.110 --> 32:48.310
that there's no violence in the villa.

32:48.310 --> 32:49.110
Zhengnian Villa

32:49.110 --> 32:50.720
may not be some powerful faction,

32:50.720 --> 32:51.400
but it's a place

32:51.400 --> 32:52.680
where we treat patients
and save their lives.

32:52.680 --> 32:53.790
Do you know how many lives from Jinxiu

32:53.790 --> 32:54.440
we've saved?

32:54.440 --> 32:55.960
Can you even count them yourselves?

32:55.960 --> 32:57.560
You broke into my villa today

32:58.110 --> 32:59.170
and used violence.

32:59.510 --> 33:00.880
I must get an explanation!

33:00.880 --> 33:01.680
Impossible.

33:02.070 --> 33:02.830
Impossible.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.750
How could Yixiao not be here?

33:04.750 --> 33:05.550
Let me search again.

33:05.550 --> 33:06.080
Ning Fei.

33:10.880 --> 33:11.480
Goodbye.

33:11.680 --> 33:12.310
Weiran.

33:12.880 --> 33:14.080
Yixiao's right here!

33:14.510 --> 33:15.200
Yixiao!

33:15.550 --> 33:17.240
Just let me know if you're here!

33:17.240 --> 33:18.720
Yixiao, answer me!

33:19.270 --> 33:21.000
Let go of me! What are you doing?

33:21.160 --> 33:22.160
Yixiao's inside.

33:22.160 --> 33:22.830
Trust me!

33:23.510 --> 33:24.310
Don't pull me!

33:24.880 --> 33:25.550
Yixiao!

33:26.440 --> 33:27.790
Trust me, Weiran.

33:36.830 --> 33:37.400
Wake up.

33:38.110 --> 33:39.160
Don't die here.

33:39.200 --> 33:39.880
Water.

33:59.240 --> 34:00.110
Water.

34:02.640 --> 34:03.440
Water.

34:06.310 --> 34:07.200
Water.

34:29.070 --> 34:29.670
My Lady.

34:29.960 --> 34:31.800
The girl has been in the medical pool
for so long.

34:31.800 --> 34:33.480
I wonder how she is now.

34:33.630 --> 34:35.190
She should be getting better.

34:35.190 --> 34:36.650
We'll know when we see her.

34:48.800 --> 34:49.590
I know him.

34:50.280 --> 34:52.940
He's a subordinate
of the First Prince of Susha.

34:53.630 --> 34:55.590
Even the subordinate
of the First Prince of Susha

34:55.590 --> 34:56.880
is so unreasonable.

34:57.550 --> 34:59.550
Do you think that girl is in danger?

35:03.880 --> 35:04.480
My Lady,

35:04.880 --> 35:06.190
why are you so afraid

35:06.190 --> 35:07.790
of the First Prince of Susha?

35:08.030 --> 35:08.670
Remember,

35:09.510 --> 35:10.670
the rules of Zhengnian Villa

35:10.670 --> 35:11.760
apply to the world,

35:12.510 --> 35:14.030
except him.

35:31.400 --> 35:33.060
You have my portrait with you.

35:47.440 --> 35:49.230
Fu Yixiao.

35:57.280 --> 35:58.940
Turns out my name is Fu Yixiao.

36:07.920 --> 36:09.150
She's been injured.

36:12.000 --> 36:12.920
Who are you?

36:14.920 --> 36:16.360
You don't know who I am?

36:23.550 --> 36:25.350
She really doesn't remember me?

36:26.000 --> 36:27.130
You're afraid of me?

36:27.590 --> 36:28.480
Why?

36:29.230 --> 36:30.440
Am I your enemy?

36:41.150 --> 36:42.680
What are you talking about?

36:42.710 --> 36:44.240
How could I be afraid of you?

36:45.670 --> 36:47.930
I've been looking for you for a long time.

36:49.630 --> 36:50.920
You saved me

36:51.440 --> 36:52.510
when I fainted just now, right?

36:52.510 --> 36:53.760
You haven't answered me.

36:53.760 --> 36:54.890
Who on earth are you?

36:55.190 --> 36:56.360
I'm your friend.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.920
Feng Suige.

36:59.000 --> 37:00.070
Feng Suige.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.920
She remains indifferent

37:02.920 --> 37:04.000
even to the name.

37:05.280 --> 37:06.940
She's really lost her memory.

37:09.800 --> 37:11.060
What's wrong with you?

37:11.920 --> 37:12.920
Do you know

37:12.920 --> 37:13.920
how I got hurt?

37:14.920 --> 37:15.550
I almost died

37:15.550 --> 37:16.920
just to save you.

37:17.920 --> 37:19.380
Yet you're asking who I am.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.690
Do you really think I'm your enemy?

37:24.150 --> 37:25.280
Why did you get hurt?

37:25.630 --> 37:26.920
What does it have to do with me?

37:26.920 --> 37:28.590
It's a long story.

37:28.920 --> 37:29.800
Can you go

37:29.840 --> 37:31.000
get me a bowl of water first?

37:31.000 --> 37:32.460
Don't change the subject.

37:42.000 --> 37:42.800
Fu Yixiao!

37:45.280 --> 37:46.480
How dare you lie to me!

37:49.360 --> 37:50.030
Gu Yu.

37:50.630 --> 37:51.880
Look who she is.

37:53.070 --> 37:54.840
We've finally found Yixiao.

38:04.110 --> 38:05.110
Don't be nervous.

38:05.480 --> 38:07.070
I said we are not enemies.

38:07.440 --> 38:08.280
Trust me.

38:10.550 --> 38:11.230
Gu Yu.

38:11.670 --> 38:13.070
What are you waiting for?

38:13.190 --> 38:14.550
Deal with the rabbit.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.920
We've finally found Yixiao.

38:16.920 --> 38:18.320
We should celebrate.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.320
As you can see,

38:30.150 --> 38:31.440
all my men are outside.

38:32.430 --> 38:33.400
If we were enemies,

38:33.400 --> 38:34.400
I would have ordered them

38:34.400 --> 38:35.480
to break in.

38:38.920 --> 38:40.360
Since you said

38:40.400 --> 38:41.480
we are friends,

38:42.110 --> 38:43.150
you must know

38:44.070 --> 38:45.320
who my enemy is

38:46.000 --> 38:47.550
and who wants to kill me.

38:50.590 --> 38:52.520
Actually, since you disappeared,

38:53.320 --> 38:54.360
I've been wondering

38:54.360 --> 38:55.800
who the murderer is.

38:56.360 --> 38:57.760
After all, very few people

38:57.760 --> 38:59.360
have the ability to kill you.

38:59.710 --> 39:00.630
Who are they?

39:09.280 --> 39:10.150
Urgent news from His Highness!

39:10.150 --> 39:11.950
Come to Zhengnian Villa to help!

39:32.920 --> 39:33.630
Gu Yu knows

39:33.630 --> 39:35.070
you don't like the smell of blood.

39:35.070 --> 39:35.840
Every time he deals with a rabbit,

39:35.840 --> 39:37.440
he'll clean it several times thoroughly.

39:37.440 --> 39:38.970
Let's get down to business.

39:40.920 --> 39:42.070
Do you remember

39:42.760 --> 39:43.920
the Battle of Pingling

39:43.920 --> 39:46.250
between Susha and Jinxiu half a month ago?

39:47.400 --> 39:49.670
What does it have to do
with who wants to kill me?

39:49.670 --> 39:50.840
Of course, it does.

39:51.480 --> 39:53.010
You're a general of Jinxiu.

39:53.280 --> 39:55.080
You also contributed to the war.

39:55.440 --> 39:56.900
In the Battle of Pingling,

39:57.190 --> 39:58.190
if you hadn't shot an arrow

39:58.190 --> 39:59.510
at the First Prince of Susha,

39:59.510 --> 40:01.240
making him fall from the horse,

40:01.800 --> 40:03.000
Zhennan Pass of Jinxiu

40:03.000 --> 40:03.760
would be occupied

40:03.760 --> 40:04.920
by Susha now.

40:05.800 --> 40:06.760
Is he dead?

40:09.710 --> 40:10.590
Almost.

40:13.030 --> 40:15.000
He narrowly escaped death.

40:17.320 --> 40:18.360
Then he's the one

40:19.110 --> 40:20.240
who wants to kill me.

40:21.150 --> 40:22.550
He came to me for revenge.

40:24.670 --> 40:26.110
Turns out it's him.

40:27.840 --> 40:28.880
I shot him down.

40:29.400 --> 40:31.060
Looks like he's not that good.

40:33.960 --> 40:35.190
Not necessarily.

40:35.760 --> 40:37.490
He actually has another title,

40:37.800 --> 40:39.280
Killer God of Susha.

40:40.150 --> 40:42.610
His reputation is feared
all over the place.

40:43.150 --> 40:45.610
He's the First Prince.
If he wants to kill me,

40:45.960 --> 40:47.420
why would he do it himself?

40:49.030 --> 40:50.090
You don't know him.

40:50.590 --> 40:51.440
He never

40:52.000 --> 40:53.960
lets a grudge go unavenged.

40:57.070 --> 40:58.190
You know him well.

41:00.670 --> 41:01.760
What's his name?

41:06.800 --> 41:07.360
Feng.

41:07.840 --> 41:08.510
Sui.

41:09.190 --> 41:09.960
Ge.

41:21.400 --> 41:23.070
Commander Fu.

41:28.960 --> 41:31.070
If I can't make sure it's foolproof,

41:33.070 --> 41:33.880
how would I dare

41:33.880 --> 41:35.800
to lay a hand on you so easily?

41:39.000 --> 41:40.230
Despicable.
